+  
+      <div data-item="0">  <img loading="lazy" src="/sites/schousing/files/styles/large/public/2024-12/12.05.24---Homebuyer-Couple.jpg?itok=ST8ZRAdq" width="480" height="319" alt="Woman on the left, man on the right, embracing in front of their home." class="image-style-large">
