+      <div class="wrap">
+            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-body-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><h3>You May Qualify for Multiple Programs</h3><p>You may qualify for more than one SC Housing program. An approved Lending Partner can help you determine which program is right for you and your family.</p><p>Contact a participating &nbsp;<a href="/homebuyers/finding-lending-partner" data-entity-type="node" data-entity-uuid="2f8986a3-94f9-4143-8e74-97731eab0ce3" data-entity-substitution="canonical" title="Finding a Lending Partner"><strong>Lending Partners</strong></a> located in the county where you plan to purchase your home.&nbsp;</p></div>
+      </div>
+    </div>
+  </div>
+              <div class="field__item">  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--accordion-container paragraph--view-mode--default">
+          
+            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-paragraph-title field--type-text field--label-hidden field__item">Overview of our Mortgage Programs</div>
+      
+      <div class="accordion field field--name-field-accordions field--type-entity-reference-revisions field--label-hidden field__items" id="adhoc-html-accordion-paragraph-7966-field-accordions">
+              <div class="field__item">  
+
+    
+
+  <div class="paragraph paragraph--type--accordion-options paragraph--view-mode--default accordion-item">
+                  <h2 class="accordion-header accordion-header-hover my-0" id="heading-7956">
+          <button class="accordion-button py-4 collapsed" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse" data-bs-target="#collapse-7956" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapse-7956">
+            <span class="text-holder">
+            SC Housing Homebuyer (BOND) Program
+            </span>
+            <span class="icon-holder">
+                <svg height="12" width="12" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
+                <line y1="0" y2="12" x1="6" x2="6"  stroke-width="3" class="accordion_icon vertical-line collapsed" />
+                <line  x1="0" x2="12" y1="6" y2="6"  stroke-width="3" class="accordion_icon"  />
+              </svg>
+            </span>
+          </button>
+        </h2>
+        <div id="collapse-7956" class="accordion-collapse collapse " aria-labelledby="heading-7956">
+          <div class="accordion-body">
+            
+            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-html-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>This is a 30-year, fixed interest rate home loan available statewide through approved banks and mortgage lenders. These loans focus on first-time homebuyers, and eligible repeat homebuyers in targeted areas. Loans must be insured or guaranteed by FHA, VA, and USDA or meet Fannie Mae HFA Preferred or Freddie Mac HFA Advantage program guidelines.&nbsp;</p><p><strong>DOWN PAYMENT ASSISTANCE -</strong>This secondary loan helps cover the down payment and closing costs on Home Loans. Borrowers receive $10,000 in assistance that is fully forgiven if they stay in the property for 15 years. &nbsp;</p><p><strong>COMMUNITY LENDING OPTIONS</strong></p><p><strong>County First</strong></p><ul><li>Loans focus on first-time homebuyers, and eligible repeat homebuyers in economically distressed targeted areas.&nbsp;</li><li>Qualifying individuals may receive a reduced interest rate.</li></ul><p><strong>Families with Disabilities</strong></p><ul><li>Loans focus on first-time homebuyers where a family member may be disabled. Qualifying individuals may receive a reduced interest rate.</li></ul><p><strong>First Generation Home Buyers&nbsp;</strong></p><ul><li>Loans focus on first-time homebuyers whose families have never had the opportunity to own a home. Qualifying individuals may receive a reduced interest rate.</li></ul><p><strong>Housing Choice Voucher &nbsp;- Homeownership</strong></p><ul><li>Loans help eligible HCV participants transition from renting to homeownership by allowing rental assistance to be used toward monthly homeownership expenses.</li></ul><p><strong>PALMETTO HEROES (PEOPLE OF SERVICE) - CURRENTLY CLOSED FOR 2026</strong></p><ul><li>SC Housing celebrates and honors the men and women who serve. Qualifying individuals receive a reduced interest rate on Home Loans. Available to the following: teachers, nurses, first responders, military, and veterans.&nbsp;</li></ul></div>
+      
+          </div>
+        </div>
+            </div>
+</div>
