+            <div class="clearfix text-formatted field field--name-field-html-text field--type-text-long field--label-hidden field__item"><p>This is a 30-year, fixed interest rate home loan available through approved banks and mortgage lenders. These loans focus on moderate income borrowers regardless of prior homeownership status. The conventional loan options provide for a minimum down payment of 3% and are also eligible for down payment and closing cost assistance and are only available for delivery to Fannie Mae and Freddie Mac by Housing Finance Agencies.&nbsp;</p></div>
